mages. Up to 16 reference images can be attached to one request for image editing.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What other image models does OpenAI have?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GPT Image 2.5 Flare, GPT Image 2, GPT Image 1 Mini and 1 more are other image models from OpenAI.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When was GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst released?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst was released on September 9, 2026.\"}}]}7c:[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"faq\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+129px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+70px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] mb-10 last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1u773s\",{\"d\":\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"p32p05\",{\"d\":\"M12 17h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-medium\",\"children\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],null]}],null,[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-border border-none p-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L83\",null,{\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"What is GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst?\",\"answer\":\"GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst is an image generation and editing model from OpenAI, positioned as the precision-oriented ti